---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy / Privacidad" description="Responsible data-use and privacy principles for InnerChispa systems.">
  <section class="hero">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-es="Legal y transparencia" data-en="Legal and transparency">Legal and transparency</span>
    <h1 data-es="Privacidad por diseño." data-en="Privacy by design.">Privacy by design.</h1>
    <p data-es="Principios de uso responsable y protección de datos para los sistemas de InnerChispa LLC y PC Doctor S.A." data-en="Responsible-use and data-protection principles for InnerChispa LLC and PC Doctor S.A. systems.">Responsible-use and data-protection principles for InnerChispa LLC and PC Doctor S.A. systems.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="grid cols-2">
    <section class="section stack">
      <h2 data-es="1. Confidencialidad" data-en="1. Confidentiality">1. Confidentiality</h2>
      <p data-es="La seguridad de la información guía cómo recolectamos, procesamos y protegemos datos operativos, credenciales y flujos de automatización." data-en="Information security guides how we collect, process, and protect operational data, credentials, and automation flows.">Information security guides how we collect, process, and protect operational data, credentials, and automation flows.</p>
      <div class="card"><strong data-es="Principios fundamentales" data-en="Core principles">Core principles</strong><ul><li data-es="Minimización: conservamos solo lo necesario para ejecutar el servicio." data-en="Minimization: we retain only what is necessary to deliver the service.">Minimization: we retain only what is necessary to deliver the service.</li><li data-es="Procesamiento local: priorizamos infraestructura privada cuando es apropiado." data-en="Local processing: we prioritize private infrastructure when appropriate.">Local processing: we prioritize private infrastructure when appropriate.</li><li data-es="Control humano: ningún entregable sensible se envía sin aprobación." data-en="Human control: no sensitive deliverable is sent without approval.">Human control: no sensitive deliverable is sent without approval.</li></ul></div>
    </section>
    <section class="section stack">
      <h2 data-es="2. Datos y credenciales" data-en="2. Data and credentials">2. Data and credentials</h2>
      <p data-es="Nuestros conectores pueden usar credenciales temporales de plataformas externas para ejecutar funciones autorizadas." data-en="Our connectors may use temporary credentials from external platforms to perform authorized functions.">Our connectors may use temporary credentials from external platforms to perform authorized functions.</p>
      <div class="card"><strong data-es="Seguridad" data-en="Security">Security</strong><p data-es="Los secretos se protegen en reposo y se transmiten mediante canales seguros y protocolos de autorización estándar." data-en="Secrets are protected at rest and transmitted through secure channels and standard authorization protocols.">Secrets are protected at rest and transmitted through secure channels and standard authorization protocols.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="section stack">
      <h2 data-es="3. Mensajería y correo" data-en="3. Messaging and email">3. Messaging and email</h2>
      <p data-es="El procesamiento se limita a requerimientos operativos, alertas, asignaciones y flujos de soporte autorizados." data-en="Processing is limited to authorized operational requests, alerts, assignments, and support workflows.">Processing is limited to authorized operational requests, alerts, assignments, and support workflows.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="section stack">
      <h2 data-es="4. Tus derechos" data-en="4. Your rights">4. Your rights</h2>
      <p data-es="Puedes solicitar acceso, corrección o eliminación de tus datos cuando corresponda. Escríbenos a" data-en="You may request access, correction, or deletion of your data where applicable. Contact us at">You may request access, correction, or deletion of your data where applicable. Contact us at</p>
      <div class="card"><a href="mailto:rlopez@innerchispa.us">rlopez@innerchispa.us</a></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
